# Local working data (never commit)
# Office documents dropped at the repo root, and anything under data/private/,
# are the IT department's working data: they hold credentials (e.g. Zoom host
# keys) and staff personal data. Real data is imported into the app, never
# committed. Rules are root-anchored so fixtures inside apps/ stay trackable.
